data.content:
The `Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi` 10.0 package upgraded from **OpenAPI.NET v1 to v2**, which introduced several breaking changes:

## Key Changes

| .NET 9 (OpenAPI.NET v1) | .NET 10 (OpenAPI.NET v2) |
|---|---|
| `OpenApiString`, `OpenApiInteger`, etc. | `JsonNode` values |
| `schema.Nullable` | `schema.Type` includes `"null"` |
| `schema.Example` (singular) | `schema.Examples` (list of `JsonNode`) |
| `new OpenApiResponse { ... }` | Same, but `Responses` is now `IDictionary<string, OpenApiResponse>` (no change needed here) |
| `OpenApiSecurityScheme` with `Reference` | `OpenApiSchemeReference` |
| `ReferenceType.SecurityScheme` | Removed — use `OpenApiSchemeReference` directly |

## Fixed Code

```csharp
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models.References;

options.AddOperationTransformer((operation, context, ct) =>
{
    var param = operation.Parameters.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Name == "api-version");
    if (param is not null)
    {
        // Example is now a JsonNode; use Examples list or set directly
        param.Schema.Examples = [JsonValue.Create("1.0")];
    }

    operation.Responses.TryAdd("401", new OpenApiResponse { Description = "Unauthorized" });

    // Use OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference instead of OpenApiSecurityScheme + OpenApiReference
    var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2");
    operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
    {
        new() { [oAuthScheme] = scopes }
    };

    return Task.CompletedTask;
});

options.AddSchemaTransformer((schema, context, ct) =>
{
    if (schema.Properties is not null)
    {
        foreach (var property in schema.Properties)
        {
            if (schema.Required?.Contains(property.Key) != true)
            {
                // Instead of Nullable = false, ensure "null" is not in the Type flags
                property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
            }
        }
    }
    return Task.CompletedTask;
});
```

## Summary of Fixes

1. **`OpenApiString` → `JsonValue.Create(...)`** — all `IOpenApiAny` types replaced by `System.Text.Json.Nodes.JsonNode`.
2. **`schema.Example` → `schema.Examples`** — now a list of `JsonNode`.
3. **`OpenApiSecurityScheme` + `OpenApiReference`** → **`OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("id")`** from `Microsoft.OpenApi.Models.References`.
4. **`schema.Nullable = false`** → **`schema.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null`** — nullable is expressed via the type flags.
